description=NoMount Suite — fully mountless: hookless VFS injection + hookless RRO overlays (no overlayfs). Root/su independent (sucompat). ⚠️ Leave the manager's "umount modules" switches OFF — nothing here is a mount, so they hide nothing; use `nomount uid block <uid>` to hide from an app. 🫥
